  "overview": "Warp through the slipgates and enter the world of Quake, the fastest, most intense 3D world yet created. From the creators of Doom comes a polygonal shredfest of epic proportions with untold horrors seeking your annihilation. A massive hit on PC, Quake rocks even harder on Sega Saturn.\n\n- Blisteringly fast and fluid 3D action\n- Amazing conversion of the PC original\n- Incredibly detailed lighting and architecture\n- 8 death-dealing weapons, from trusty axe to mighty Thunderbolt\n- 13 types of fully polygonal enemies, from grunts to shamblers"
